From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 07:05:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Tune gfx1201 Qwen block FP8 GEMMs

- Add four Qwen 3 4B projection configs.
- Use validated split-K decode tiles.
- Reach 115.68 output tokens per second.
- Trail the vLLM backend by 7.6 percent.

Tools used:
- GPT-5.6 Sol: GPT-5.6 Sol

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
